        "filename": "common/i2c.c",
        "patchSetId": 5
      },
      "lineNbr": 932,
      "author": {
        "id": 1128369
      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-09-16T21:35:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Idea here is to test randomly. In the system I2C read/writes are random on each of the devices. Plan is to make the I2C fail by randomizing.\nMay be I can add a separate CL to give option to do random/sequence test.",
      "parentUuid": "ab415e2d_f9255ab6",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 932,
        "startChar": 2,
        "endLine": 932,
        "endChar": 24
      },
      "revId": "e1a138f29f168ff6a4f93ef7e1bd062984bf5215",
